WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:04.332
Unit twenty-two. CPR Awareness!

2
00:00:05.293 --> 00:00:09.161
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.211 --> 00:00:12.218
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.268 --> 00:00:15.672
Today we learn about CPR Awareness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:20.557
CPR. Say it with me. CPR!

6
00:00:24.037 --> 00:00:27.971
Cardiac arrest. Say it with me. Cardiac arrest!

7
00:00:31.422 --> 00:00:35.805
Chest compressions. Say it with me. Chest compressions!

8
00:00:39.346 --> 00:00:43.396
Emergency number. Say it with me. Emergency number!

9
00:00:46.883 --> 00:00:49.800
AED. Say it with me. AED!

10
00:00:53.314 --> 00:00:57.464
Unresponsive. Say it with me. Unresponsive!

11
00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:04.034
Breathing. Say it with me. Breathing!

12
00:01:07.502 --> 00:01:10.268
Help. Say it with me. Help!

13
00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:24.532
In cardiac arrest, a person is unresponsive and not breathing normally. Call the emergency number, start chest compressions, and use an AED if one is available. Quick help saves lives.

14
00:01:24.582 --> 00:01:27.483
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:28.776 --> 00:01:33.865
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.915 --> 00:01:35.429
Chest compressions!

17
00:01:36.452 --> 00:01:41.609
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.659 --> 00:01:42.809
Breathing!

19
00:01:43.621 --> 00:01:50.532
Did you know? Hands-only CPR — pushing hard and fast in the centre of the chest — can keep blood flowing to the brain!

20
00:01:50.582 --> 00:01:52.616
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.854 --> 00:02:01.626
Think and answer. What are the first steps if someone collapses?

22
00:02:01.676 --> 00:02:02.826
Great answer!

23
00:02:03.888 --> 00:02:08.640
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:11.324
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

